  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-475-504">親の手紙が泡吹いた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-504-533">恋は空みた肩揺つた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-533-576">俺は灰色のステッキを呑んだ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-576-587">足　足</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-587-604">足　足</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)"><seg source="#source-604-627">足　足</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 9em" rend="first-line-indent(9)"><seg source="#source-627-659">足</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-659-685">万年筆の徒歩旅行</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-685-714">電信棒よ御辞儀しろ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-714-717">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-717-732"><rb>腹</rb><rt>ナカ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-732-767">の皮がカシヤカシヤする</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-767-798">胯の下から右手みた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-798-827">一切合切みんな下駄</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-827-865">フイゴよフイゴよ口をきけ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-865-894">土橋の上で胸打つた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-894-936">ヒネモノだからおまけ致します</seg></p>
    </body>
